    A("gen3-bits3", f"subsetSumBrute_{v}", f"bool subsetSumBrute_{v}(const vector<int>& a, int t) {{ int n = a.size(); for (int mask = 0; mask < (1 << n); ++mask) {{ int sum = 0; for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i) if (mask & (1 << i)) sum += a[i]; if (sum == t) return true; }} return false; }}", "O(n 2^n)", "O(1)", "exact", ["bits"])
